<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Carpenter expands PNG exploration.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Carpenter expands PNG exploration.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carpenter Pacific Resources NL said on Wednesday it had been granted a new gold exploration licence in Papua New Guinea (PNG).</p>
<p>Carpenter said it had been awarded EL1142 covering an area of 1514 square kilometres in the West Sepik province of PNG and neighbouring the company's existing EL904 permit.</p>
<p>&quot;Significant quantities of alluvial gold have been mined in the region for a number of years and mining is continuing,&quot; executive chairman Stan Shaw said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Our aim of exploring this region is to locate the hardrock source of that alluvial gold,&quot; Shaw said.</p>
</text>
